  "details": "The idea would be similar to occlusion portals but it only unrenders players that are behind it.\nThis would save framerate a ton for bigger community worlds that utilize it well. There are some worlds that I know of and work on that are heavily optimized and even then some people lag heavily due to not the world but in fact the avatars. If this was implemented we could have walls to break the room into chunks of avatar rendering on a toggle if a user really needs it and it would help the user plenty I have no doubt.",
